      "y": -170,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "HUD rebuilt as four labelled zones instead of hard-coded x offsets at 20 / 260 / 410.\n\nScore is the real addition: today it exists only on the end screens, so the whole reward loop is invisible while you actually play.",
      "page": "page-1"
    },
